 "notes": [
  "Fast backend: exact re-implementation (Numba formation / residues / descriptors / NMS / metal candidates & geometry, LightGBM-free forests, fp64-exact Triton kernels on GPU). It reuses the reference Numba ray march and neighbour sums on CPU (exact re-implementations were not faster).",
